==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|ѣ́хать||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*yeh₂-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ěxati}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|е́хать}}
** {{audio|ru|Ru-ехать.ogg}}
* {{IPA|ru|[ˈjexat͡sʲ]|a=Belarus}} (''phonetic respelling'': е́хаць)
* {{IPA|ru|[ˈjɛxɐtʲ]|a=Ukraine}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|е́хать|impf|pf=пое́хать}}

# to [[go]] (by horse or vehicle), to [[ride]], to [[drive]]
# to [[travel]]
# to [[move]] from a [[place]], to [[slide]] [[off]]

====Usage notes====
* {{U:sla:directional verb|ru|uni|impf=е́хать|pf=пое́хать|other=е́здить}}
* The imperative forms {{l|ru|едь}} / {{l|ru|е́дьте}} and {{l|ru|е́хай}} / {{l|ru|е́хайте}} (including derivatives with prefixes) are used but are considered illiterate and are not recommended for use. The recommended imperative forms are [[suppletive]] forms {{l|ru|поезжа́й}} / {{l|ru|поезжа́йте}} but {{l|ru|езжа́й}} / {{l|ru|езжа́йте}} are also acceptable. The derivatives (приезжать, заезжать, выезжать, etc.) use prefix + {{l|ru|езжа́й}} / prefix + {{l|ru|езжа́йте}}. For negative imperative, use {{l|ru|не е́зди}}.
* The present adverbial form {{l|ru|е́дучи}} is dated. Occasionally, in colloquial speech, other forms are encountered, such as {{l|ru|е́дя}}, {{l|ru|е́хая}} or {{l|ru|езжа́я}}, but these are proscribed.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|irreg|е́хать|pradp=е́дучи1|notes=1 Dated. See usage notes.|impr_sg3=е́хай2|impr_pl3=е́хайте2|impr_sg4=едь2|impr_pl4=е́дьте2|notes2=2 Proscribed, colloquial.}}

====Derived terms====
* ''See {{m|ru|е́здить}} for derived verbs.''

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|езда́}}

===See also===
* {{l|ru|е́здить}}
* {{l|ru|идти́}}
* {{l|ru|кры́ша пое́хала}}
